				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5392</link>
				<description>

&lt;p&gt;Item #: SCP-5392&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stolle-7b&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7061608&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606572800&quot; alt=&quot;Stolle 7B&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7061608)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stolle-7b&quot;  &gt;Stolle 7B&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
				<pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2020 14:10:45 +0000</pubDate>
												<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Item #: SCP-5392</p> <p>Object Class: Euclid</p> <p>Special Containment Procedures: SCP-5392 is to be kept in an airtight 10m x 7m x 10m alloy steel cell. The temperature in the cell must be between 0-32 degrees Fahrenheit and to be routinely filled with carbon dioxide every 4-6 days. The walls of the cell are 7m thick and the cell is to be kept quiet at all times. Pressure sensors must be used to monitor SCP-5392 due to its inability to be seen in screens or on reflections and its unique temporal capabilities. 2-4 personnel are to enter to feed SCP-5392 under all circumstances and are to use white noise to disguise themselves.</p> <p>Description: SCP-5392 is a humanoid female creature approximately 3.06 meters tall with long arms stretching its entire body and legs 0.96 meters tall. SCP-5392 has long black hair and its epidermis is completely gray in color. Origins of this creature are still unknown. SCP-5392 normally shows little to no muscle mass whatsoever except for it’s extremely large torso region, but does not need to eat or drink if fed 4-5mm of human saliva every 4-6 days.</p> <p>If SCP-5392 is not fed between the given time, it can change its shape, facial structure, and diameter up to 8.92 meters tall to lure prey into the cell or escape confinement, although no matter what shape it morphs into it keeps its pale eyes.</p> <p>The eyes don’t seem to function at all, leading to SCP-5392 using some sort of echolocation technique to find prey. SCP-5392‘s victims are almost always children to the ages of 4-7. The attack technique of SCP-5392 is to use its echolocation, smell, and temporal capabilities to isolate 2-3 children.</p> <p>It then uses its long arms to pin the victim down and claw out their tongue, opening its torso revealing a jagged teeth-filled mouth inside her stomach region to excrete a long, circular, wormlike tongue and insert it inside the victim’s esophagus, feeding on their bodily fluids.</p> <p>SCP-5392‘s mortality rate is %100, although it shows no memory of its attacks. SCP-5392 can run up to 13km per hour, and is known to kill any witnesses of the feedings up to any means necessary.</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stolle-7b" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7061608&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606572800" alt="Stolle 7B" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7061608)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stolle-7b" >Stolle 7B</a></span></p> 
				 	]]>
